> The model does not run to completion and after reading  this <https://martynplummer.wordpress.com/2016/09/14/you-can-always-make-it-faster/> post I think the problem I’m having is referred to as a “memory leak”. Essentially as I start to run the model the RAM usage surges to maximum capacity until my operating system is destroyed (PC specs: 2.13GHz Intel Xeon CPU with 32GB of RAM).
