Hi Blanca,

I think the problem is in these two lines:

pr1[t,j] <- phi1[t]*q1[t]*phi2[t+1]*q2[t+1]*prod(phi3[(t+2):j])* prod(q3[(t+1):(j-1)])*prod(p3[(t+2):j])

pr2[t,j] <- phi2[t]*q2[t]*prod(phi3[(t+1):j])* prod(q3[t:(j-1)])*prod(p3[(t+1):j])

They should become :

pr1[t,j] <- phi1[t]*q1[t]*phi2[t+1]*q2[t+1]*prod(phi3[(t+2):j])* prod(q3[(t+2):(j-1)]) * p3[j]

pr2[t,j] <- phi2[t]*q2[t]*prod(phi3[(t+1):j])* prod(q3[(t+1):(j-1)])* p3[j]

With kind regards

Michael

